  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:19.490" end="00:23.970" ttm:agent="v1">I don't know why shawty's smiling with a loaded gun</p>
      <p begin="00:23.970" end="00:28.350" ttm:agent="v1">Point it at me cock it back come on let's have some fun</p>
      <p begin="00:28.350" end="00:32.700" ttm:agent="v1">You think a knife would make me shiver try me honeybun</p>
      <p begin="00:32.700" end="00:37.230" ttm:agent="v1">I'm playing dead so you can celebrate you think you won</p>
      <p begin="00:37.230" end="00:39.040" ttm:agent="v1">Tell me a lie</p>
      <p begin="00:39.040" end="00:41.960" ttm:agent="v1">I'll make your fucking nose bleed</p>
      <p begin="00:41.960" end="00:46.490" ttm:agent="v1">What's the point in hiding, I can smell your fucking nosebleed</p>
      <p begin="00:46.490" end="00:50.980" ttm:agent="v1">Tell me a lie and you'll see your fucking nosebleed</p>
      <p begin="00:50.980" end="00:55.600" ttm:agent="v1">Try to go to sleep you close your eyes but now your eyes bleed</p>
      <p begin="00:55.600" end="01:00.190" ttm:agent="v1">What's the point in hiding I can smell your fucking nosebleed</p>
      <p begin="01:00.190" end="01:03.060" ttm:agent="v1">Tell them I'm the worst you suck at lying</p>
      <p begin="01:03.060" end="01:05.740" ttm:agent="v1">Look your nosebleeds</p>
      <p begin="01:05.740" end="01:10.190" ttm:agent="v1">I'm not your fucking enemy you know me</p>
      <p begin="01:10.190" end="01:12.590" ttm:agent="v1">But once you run your mouth</p>
      <p begin="01:12.590" end="01:14.130" ttm:agent="v1">You know me</p>
      <p begin="01:14.130" end="01:16.800" ttm:agent="v1">You fucked up, you fucked up</p>
      <p begin="01:16.800" end="01:19.160" ttm:agent="v1">Man You've gone too far</p>
      <p begin="01:19.160" end="01:23.690" ttm:agent="v1">I already felt suspicious right on from the start</p>
      <p begin="01:23.690" end="01:28.170" ttm:agent="v1">I'll fucking play you till you can't no more I'll throw the dart</p>
      <p begin="01:28.170" end="01:32.890" ttm:agent="v1">Now I cannot let you go without a fucking scar</p>
      <p begin="01:32.890" end="01:35.540" ttm:agent="v1">You fucked up, you fucked up</p>
      <p begin="01:35.540" end="01:37.800" ttm:agent="v1">Man You've gone too far</p>
      <p begin="01:37.800" end="01:41.810" ttm:agent="v1">I already felt suspicious right on from the start</p>
      <p begin="01:41.810" end="01:47.090" ttm:agent="v1">I'll fucking play you till you can't no more I'll throw the dart</p>
      <p begin="01:47.090" end="01:52.910" ttm:agent="v1">Now I cannot let you go without a fucking scar</p>
      <p begin="01:52.910" end="01:57.320" ttm:agent="v1">Eyes red, think I'm going insane</p>
      <p begin="01:57.320" end="02:01.800" ttm:agent="v1">Head is spinning adrenaline in my veins</p>
      <p begin="02:01.800" end="02:06.630" ttm:agent="v1">Knuckles bleedin' but I don't feel the pain</p>
      <p begin="02:06.630" end="02:09.550" ttm:agent="v1">I like the way you're screaming my name</p>
      <p begin="02:09.550" end="02:14.000" ttm:agent="v1">Tell me a lie and you'll see your fucking nosebleed</p>
      <p begin="02:14.000" end="02:18.820" ttm:agent="v1">Try to go to sleep you close your eyes but now your eyes bleed</p>
      <p begin="02:18.820" end="02:23.220" ttm:agent="v1">What's the point in hiding I can smell your fucking nosebleed</p>
      <p begin="02:23.220" end="02:26.150" ttm:agent="v1">Tell them I'm the worst you suck at lying</p>
